(*) Skeptic probe 4: the stored time is one global, so timed regions cannot
(*) nest.  The outer printTime must report the interval since the inner one,
(*) not since the outer recordTime.  Both paths should agree on that structure.
component SkepticNested
export Executable
run():() = do
    recordTime(0)
    println("outer started")
    recordTime(0)
    println("inner started")
    printTime(0)
    printTime(0)
    println("NESTED OK")
end
end
